.TH "PACE DEVICE" "1" "2026-05-17" "0.1.0" "pace device Manual"
.SH NAME
pace\-device \- Registered Garmin devices.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pace device
[OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Registered Garmin devices.
.SH COMMANDS
.PP
\fBlist\fP
  List all registered devices.
  See \fBpace device-list(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBlist\fP command.
.PP
\fBlast-used\fP
  Show the device most recently synced.
  See \fBpace device-last-used(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBlast-used\fP command.
.PP
\fBsettings\fP
  Show settings for a specific device.
  See \fBpace device-settings(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBsettings\fP command.
.PP
\fBalarms\fP
  Show device alarm settings.
  See \fBpace device-alarms(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBalarms\fP command.
.PP
\fBsolar\fP
  Solar charging data for a device over a...
  See \fBpace device-solar(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBsolar\fP command.
